  "notes": "切网不卡住，回忆及时更新\n\n- 修复连接、断开 VPN 或切换接口入口时，邮箱验证和回忆提醒设置可能持续显示处理中的问题。\n- 退出后重新登录会清理旧会话输入，旧请求不会回填新页面；活动退出确认与回忆导出同步保护账号边界。\n- 回忆页跨月后自动更新可选月份和年度，从后台返回也会刷新；主动选中的历史月份继续保留。\n",
  "notesEn": "Smoother network changes and timely Memories\n\n- Fixed email verification and memory notification settings getting stuck while a VPN connection or API endpoint changes.\n- Signing out and back in clears the previous session's input. Late responses, group-exit confirmations and memory exports respect the current account session.\n- Available months and years refresh while Memories is open and when the app resumes. Your explicitly selected historical month stays selected.\n",
